:: Lake Underwater [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $stress gte 10000>><<passoutlake>>
<<else>>
You are beneath the lake. You swim over dark silt and between tall weeds.
<<if $loglocations is 1>><<log "Was beneath the lake." $locationimportance>><</if>>

<<if $daystate is "night">>
	<<if $weather is "rain">>
	The water is black. It dulls the sound of the rain above.
	<<elseif $weather is "clear">>
	The plants glisten in moonlight.
	<<else>>
	The water is black.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $weather is "rain">>
	The water is dark. It dulls the sound of the rain above.
	<<elseif $weather is "clear">>
	Sunlight pierces the gloom.
	<<else>>
	The water is dark.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Swim inside ruin|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>><br>
<br>
<<link [[Surface|Lake Depths]]>><<set $lakesurface to 1>><</link>><br>

<</if>>


:: Lake Ruin [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $loglocations is 1>><<log "Was in the ruins beneath the lake." $locationimportance>><</if>>


You are in the submerged ruin beneath the lake. Glowing purple lichen covers ancient walls.<br><br>

<<if $stress gte 10000>><<passoutlake>>
<<else>>

<<if $sciencelichenknown is 1 and $sciencelichenlake isnot 1 and $scienceproject is "ongoing">>
<<link [[Retrieve lichen for your science project|Lake Lichen]]>><<set $sciencelichenlake to 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Swim deeper|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>><br>
<<link [[Swim outside|Lake Underwater]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>><br>

<</if>>

:: Lake Ruin Deep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $loglocations is 1>><<log "Was deep in the ruins beneath the lake." $locationimportance>><</if>>

<<if $ruinpots is undefined>><<potinit>><</if>>

You are deep in the submerged ruin beneath the lake. Pots of different sizes fill the room. There's an ancient door opposite the entrance.

<<if $lakeruinkey isnot 2>>
It's closed.
<<else>>
It's open.
<</if>>


<br><br>

<<if $stress gte 10000>><<passoutlake>>
<<else>>

<<ruinoptions>>

<</if>>

:: Lake Ruin Door [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<set $lakeruinkey to 2>>
<<set $logprep to "I used a bronze key I found to open the ancient door in the lake ruins, beyond the door I found a plinth with an ivory necklace atop it.">>
You hear the ancient mechanism creak and the door groans open. Beyond is a plinth, stood alone in a rubble-strewn room. Atop it sits an ivory necklace. It's studded with blue jewels.<br><br>

<<link [[Take it|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 2000>><<if $antiqueivorynecklace is undefined>><<set $antiqueivorynecklace to "found">><</if>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I took the necklace.">><<log $logprep 3>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Leave|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I didn't take the necklace.">><<log $logprep 1>><</link>><br>


:: Lake Ruin Plinth [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $loglocations is 1>><<log "Was in the plinth room of ruins beneath the lake." $locationimportance>><</if>>

You are deep in the lake ruin, in a small room with a plinth.

<<if $antiqueivorynecklace is undefined>>
An ivory necklace sits atop it. It's studded with blue jewels.<br><br>

<<link [[Take it|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 2000>><<if $antiqueivorynecklace is undefined>><<set $antiqueivorynecklace to "found">><</if>><<log "I took the ivory necklace from the plinth room of ruins beneath the lake." 3>><</link>><br>
<<else>>
<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Leave|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><</link>><br>

:: Lake Pots [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $stress gte 10000>><<passoutlake>>
<<else>>
/*<<set _r to $ruinpots.length/10>><<set $searchpot to random(_r)>>/* pick random pot from the 1st 10% */
<<set $searchpot to Math.round($rng/10)>>/* pick random pot from the 1st 10 */

<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "swarm">>/* 2% Should presence of swarms be separate from contents? */
<<if $swarmdisable is "f">>
You reach inside one of the pots. Swarms of small fish surge out, surrounding you.<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Lake Swarm]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>><br>
<<else>>
You reach inside one of the pots. School of small fish suddenly surge out of the otherwise empty pot surprising you.<<gstress>><<stress 3>><br><br>
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, school of small fish surged out of it." 1>>
<</if>>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "snapper">>/* 8% */
You reach inside one of the pots. Something inside snaps at you. You pull your hand away in time, but it was close.<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, something inside it tried to snap at me." 1>>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "box">>/* 20% */
You reach inside one of the pots, and find a small ivory box. It's sealed by a bronze lock.<br><br>
<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].t is "gold">>
<<run $boxdumps.push("gold necklace")>><<set $phase to 2>>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].t is "silver">>
<<run $boxdumps.push("silver ring")>><<set $phase to 1>>
<</if>>

<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
	The box itself is very old. It must be valuable.<br><br>

	<<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<run $boxdumps.pop()>><<if $antiquebox is undefined>><<set $antiquebox to "found">><</if>>
	<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins and found a locked small ivory box in it that I took without trying to open it." 2>>
	<</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it had a small locked ivory box.">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>><br>
<<if $lakeruinkey gte 1>><<link [[Try to open it with bronze key|Lake Ruin Box Key]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it had a small locked ivory box.">><</link>><<loxygen>><br><</if>>
<<ruinoptions "I searched a pot in the lake ruins and found a small ivory box but I ignored it " "Leave the box and:">>/*  */


<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "dust">>/* 28% */

You reach inside one of the pots. There's purple dust at the bottom. Your probing disturbs it, and it swirls around your arm. You feel heated.<<gstress>><<stress 3>><<garousal>><<arousal 6>><br><br>
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, there was purple dust in it." 1>>
<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "key">> /* 10% */
<<if $lakeruinkey is undefined>>
You reach inside one of the pots. You find a decaying bronze key.<br><br>
<<set $lakeruinkey to 1>>
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, there was a bronze key in it." 2>>
<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
<<else>>
You reach inside one of the pots. It's empty.
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>
<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
<</if>>

 /* 40% */
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "ceramics">> /* 20% of 40% = 8% */
You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of broken ceramics.
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "mud">>
You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of mud.
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was full of mud." 1>>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "pebbles">>
You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of pebbles.
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was full of pebbles." 1>>

<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "empty">>
You reach inside one of the pots. It's empty.
<<log "I searched a pot in the lake ruins, it was empty." 1>>

<<else>>

<</if>>

<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].s is true>>
 You've already searched this pot.
<<else>>
<<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].s to true>>
<</if>>


<br><br>
<<if $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "swarm">>
<<elseif $ruinpots[$searchpot].i is "box">><<set $ruinpots[$searchpot].i to "empty">>
<<else>>
<<ruinoptions>>
<</if>>
/* move pot to the back of array and select it*/
<<run $ruinpots.push($ruinpots[$searchpot])>>
<<run $ruinpots.deleteAt($searchpot)>>
<<set $searchpot to $ruinpots.length-1>>

<</if>>/*closes passout check*/

:: Lake Ruin Dumped Box [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] isnot "open">>
<<if $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] is "silver ring">><<set $phase to 1>><<elseif $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] is "gold necklace">><<set $phase to 2>><</if>>
You pick up a box that is still locked.<br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I picked up a still locked discarded box in the lake ruins,">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>><br>
<<if $lakeruinkey gte 1>><<link [[Try to open it with bronze key|Lake Ruin Box Key]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to "I picked up a still locked discarded box in the lake ruins,">><</link>><<loxygen>><br><</if>>
<<ruinoptions "I picked up a discarded box that was locked but left it " "Leave the box and:">>

<<else>>
You take an opened old box with you. It belongs in a museum.<<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<if $antiquebox is undefined>><<set $antiquebox to "found">><</if>><br>
<<run $boxdumps.pop()>>
<<log "I picked up a discarded box in the lake ruins." 1>>
<<ruinoptions>>

<</if>>


:: Lake Ruin Box Key [nobr]

<<if $rng gte 4 and $phase isnot 2>>/* combines to about 8% chance of working */
You tried to open the box with a bronze key but it doesn't fit.<br><br>
<<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><<set $logprep to $logprep+"">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>><br>
<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
<<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<if $antiquebox is undefined>><<set $antiquebox to "found">><</if>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I tried using the key I had on it, it didn't fit so I took the box as is.">><<log $logprep 2>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<ruinoptions "I tried using the key I had on it, it didn't fit so I left it " "Leave the box and:">>
<<else>>
You tried to open the box with a bronze key and surprisingly it worked and
<<if $phase is 2>>you find a gold necklace <<set $antiquemoney += 500>><<if $antiquegoldnecklace is undefined>><<set $antiquegoldnecklace to "found">><</if>><<set $itemname to "a gold necklace">>
<<elseif $phase is 1>>you find a silver ring <<set $antiquemoney += 30>><<if $antiquesilverring is undefined>><<set $antiquesilverring to "found">><</if>><<set $itemname to "a gold necklace">>
<</if>> inside it that you
<<set $logprep to $logprep+" I somehow managed to open it using the bronze key I had and it had "+$itemname+" in it that I took along with the box.">>
<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
take along with the empty box.
<<else>>
take.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<run $boxdumps.pop()>>
<<log $logprep 2>>
<<ruinoptions>>
<</if>>

:: Lake Ruin Box [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>

	<<if $skulduggery lte ($skulduggerydifficulty + 100)>>
	<<skulduggeryskilluse>>
	<<else>>
	<span class="blue">That was too easy. You didn't learn anything.</span><br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $phase is 2>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I unlocked it and found a gold necklace that I took">>
	You find a gold necklace.<<set $antiquemoney += 500>><<if $antiquegoldnecklace is undefined>><<set $antiquegoldnecklace to "found">><</if>><br><br>
	<<elseif $phase is 1>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I unlocked it and found a silver ring that I took">>
	You find a silver ring.<<set $antiquemoney += 30>><<if $antiquesilverring is undefined>><<set $antiquesilverring to "found">><</if>><br><br>
	<</if>>

<<if $historytrait gte 4>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" along with the box">>
You take the empty box too. It belongs in a museum.<<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<if $antiquebox is undefined>><<set $antiquebox to "found">><</if>><br><br>
<<run $boxdumps.pop()>>
<<else>>
<<set $boxdumps[$boxdumps.length-1] to "open">>
<</if>>

<<set $logprep to $logprep+".">>
<<log $logprep 2>>
<<ruinoptions>>

<<else>>

You fail to pick the lock.<br><br>
<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
<<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 20>><<if $antiquebox is undefined>><<set $antiquebox to "found">><</if>><<set $logprep to $logprep+" I just took it as is after failing to open it.">><<log $logprep 2>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Try again|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>><br>
<<if $lakeruinkey gte 1>><<link [[Try to open it with bronze key|Lake Ruin Box Key]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>><br><</if>>
<<ruinoptions " I left it after failing to open it">>
<</if>>


