:: Lake Swarm Finish [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>

<<if $stress gte 10000>>

It's all just too much for you. You pass out.<br><br>

<<if $upperoff isnot 0>>
<<upperruined>>
<</if>>
<<if $loweroff isnot 0>>
<<lowerruined>>
<</if>>
<<if $underoff isnot 0>>
<<underruined>>
<</if>>

